# The two versioned floors are the ones measured against actual API use:
# Gtk.FileDialog and Gtk.FontDialog are GTK 4.10, and Adw.AlertDialog,
# Adw.Dialog, Adw.PreferencesDialog and Adw.AboutDialog are libadwaita 1.5.
# Without them a too-old stack installs cleanly and then dies at import, which
# matters because this package is also the only channel Debian has.
# gtksourceview5, vte and libspelling are deliberately unversioned: nothing
# has established what their real minimum is, and a guessed floor locks out
# users who would have been fine.
Depends: ${python3:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         python3-gi,
         gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.10),
         gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5),
         gir1.2-vte-3.91,
         gir1.2-gtksource-5,
         gir1.2-spelling-1
Description: native GTK4 desktop app to manage Claude Code sessions
 Collins browses every Claude Code session on your machine in a
 sidebar grouped by project, lets you name and star them, and resumes any of
 them in embedded terminal tabs.
 .
 It is an unofficial community tool, not affiliated with Anthropic, and never
 modifies the agents' own session data.
